    },
    "body": "Follow-up to #2243: the bulk field-add missed the tests/ directory, so the two StackConfig literals in tests/cuda_stack_ops_parity.rs (and d4_map_codec_adapter.rs, temporal_cli.rs) were missing read_router: None. This only compiled under --features cuda, so CI (which does not compile cuda) never caught it; the pod bootstrap parity check (cargo test --test cuda_stack_ops_parity) failed to compile with E0063 missing field read_router.\n\nFix: add read_router: None to the 13 StackConfig literals across the three test files. cargo check --all-targets passes (non-cuda); the cuda compile is re-verified on the pod bootstrap.\n\nReferences #2029 (never Closes).",
    "closed_by": {
      "login": "Casey-allard",
      "id": 112731500,
